{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a tiny pixel city that grows by itself. Place buildings to increase your brick production, unlock new structures, and watch your miniature world bustle with people, cars, and buses as it expands. It\u2019s a calm,  city builder where your town keeps working even when you take a break.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing  Gameplay</strong><br>Place buildings and watch your brick production climb as your city becomes more efficient.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/0fd92f535ee7de3d69a3d579c047c096.poster.avif?t=1772994195\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/0fd92f535ee7de3d69a3d579c047c096.webm?t=1772994195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/0fd92f535ee7de3d69a3d579c047c096.mp4?t=1772994195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Pixel City</strong><br>Tiny people wander the streets, vehicles pass by, and the world comes to life as you expand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/f782c8a9ad4e3f9a89abfc61419efebd.poster.avif?t=1772994195\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951870/extras/f782c8a9ad4e3f9a89abfc61419efebd.webm?t=1772994195\" type=\"video/webm; cod